# fx-m-all01 -- W3-FX trigger visuals, Allied 1 (Lone Guardian): the bridge-hut
# objective arrows (PlayAnimAt 479 = ARRWSE at waypoints BE / BH) and the
# opening camera scroll ("Start Scroll": MoveCameraToWaypoint S at speed
# Value 1 = 0.003 progress per frame). Note: the "Break Bridges" Apply100Damage
# actions draw nothing themselves [RE: FUN_006dfa00 = five DamageArea(100,
# C4Warhead) calls, no AnimClass]; see docs/re/effects.md §5.3.
set render_every 300
set on_quit continue
set campaign ALL01T.MAP GDI
until 60 scene == campaign-load
click start
until 400 scene == game
require scene == game
wait 15
cheat reveal
view cell 81 48
cheat camp_fire "Bridge Hut Anim"                   @W3-FX-41
wait 4
assert fx_anims >= 2                                @W3-FX-41
view cell 81 48
shot a01_bridge_hut_arrows                          @W3-FX-41
let c0 = cam_y
cheat camp_fire "Start Scroll"                      @W3-FX-48
wait 60
assert cam_y != $c0                                 @W3-FX-48
shot a02_camera_scroll                              @W3-FX-48
end
